    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.extra\n\n### Description\n\nCurrently you can choose `:Pick git_hunks` to either show staged or unstaged files. However, new untracked files are not included in either of these. It would be useful to me if untracked files were included with unstaged files.",
