    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nThis behavior is according to how `git diff` itself works, as [`pickers.git_hunks()` is explicitly a wrapper around it](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/0420076298c4457f200c2de468f65d080597a347/doc/mini-extra.txt#L434). Probably a better name would be `git_diff`, but oh well 🤷  I think having this be more in line with how `git diff` works is a better long-term design than including untracked files with in unstaged changes (although it is useful, I agree).\n\nSo I am afraid I am going to close this a not planned.",
